    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The mouse is the controller!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a PC game, but don't use the keyboard at all, play only with the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheel the mouse as fast as you can and catch fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/ea5d576f620e5d47fbe653b409a63b86.poster.avif?t=1743461320\" width=476 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/ea5d576f620e5d47fbe653b409a63b86.webm?t=1743461320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/ea5d576f620e5d47fbe653b409a63b86.mp4?t=1743461320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>128 species of fish!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch piranhas, orcas, hippos, monkeys, and other fish beyond the norm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/f9ac981f5c5a9fe4b634f7f5ad77e97f.poster.avif?t=1743461320\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/f9ac981f5c5a9fe4b634f7f5ad77e97f.webm?t=1743461320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/f9ac981f5c5a9fe4b634f7f5ad77e97f.mp4?t=1743461320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's go shopping!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell the fish you catch and earn money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find items to move to new stages and equipment for sale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/4497b413b603cc7ab9c9b7471e9c3e0d.poster.avif?t=1743461320\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/4497b413b603cc7ab9c9b7471e9c3e0d.webm?t=1743461320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/4497b413b603cc7ab9c9b7471e9c3e0d.mp4?t=1743461320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your own equipment!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want the best fishing rod or a full set of special equipment, it's all up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even make your fishing rod so that it doesn't deplete your stamina, or so that it's more money-saving...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/5e35364af07e6a154b0983659464eb14.poster.avif?t=1743461320\" width=454 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/5e35364af07e6a154b0983659464eb14.webm?t=1743461320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/5e35364af07e6a154b0983659464eb14.mp4?t=1743461320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Achievements!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the rarest fish in each area, or catch 250 fish in a day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve various conditions and get gorgeous trophies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/afd65ce35af1fb71d99e297f453be4eb.poster.avif?t=1743461320\" width=464 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/afd65ce35af1fb71d99e297f453be4eb.webm?t=1743461320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/afd65ce35af1fb71d99e297f453be4eb.mp4?t=1743461320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3000\u3000</span>\u00a0cooperation\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3000\u3000</span><br>Kobe Institute of Computing-College of Computing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seiji</p>",
